From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:32:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] j604: integrate the J604 series onto Aurora 7.3
 (shipping snapshot)

The 1.617 J604 series resolved onto Aurora
6ff31cbfa2 per file: our KEPT/REWORKED commits stepped onto Aurora's
file with hand resolutions, DT
duplicates folded into overrides of Aurora's t8132-peripherals nodes,
J604 single fan and mTPL pressure key in DT, JPEG t8132 match, and the
ISP window fix (7aa6a2e266, 30ec80ce71) carried.

One snapshot commit so 7.3.0.aurora1-1.701 can ship; it is to be split
into reviewed group commits later.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
